2026-08-18T22:20:16.4110438Z 1 residual  <NA>  <NA>  residual residual      <NA>    <NA>            y1
2026-08-18T22:20:16.4111156Z   to_response    class parameter estimate      min      max n_values
2026-08-18T22:20:16.4111954Z 1          y2 residual     rho12 0.619665 0.619665 0.619665       40
2026-08-18T22:20:16.4112677Z   link_estimate  link_min  link_max modelled   conf.status interval_source
2026-08-18T22:20:16.4113631Z 1     0.7244622 0.7244622 0.7244622    FALSE not_requested   not_available
