2026-08-18T22:20:16.4184274Z > 
2026-08-18T22:20:16.4184529Z > # One distributional parameter at a time: a named numeric vector.
2026-08-18T22:20:16.4184876Z > fixef(fit, "mu")
2026-08-18T22:20:16.4185086Z (Intercept)           x 
2026-08-18T22:20:16.4185300Z   0.2280971   0.5919767 
2026-08-18T22:20:16.4185504Z > coef(fit, "sigma")
