2026-08-18T22:20:16.4386296Z > 
2026-08-18T22:20:16.4386419Z > # Fitted for univariate Gaussian mu with coords:
2026-08-18T22:20:16.4386553Z > bf(y ~ x + spatial(1 | site, coords = coords), sigma ~ z)
